{"id":775,"date":"2023-01-26T14:39:57","date_gmt":"2023-01-26T14:39:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/digital-banking\/mobile-wallet\/"},"modified":"2023-04-04T19:17:26","modified_gmt":"2023-04-04T19:17:26","slug":"mobile-wallet","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/digital-banking\/mobile-wallet\/","title":{"rendered":"Business Mobile Wallet"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Use Averon Trust&#8217;s Business Visa<sup>\u00ae<\/sup> Debit Card on Mobile Wallet<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking for a more secure and convenient way to make in-person and online purchases for your business? Try linking your Averon Trust debit card to the encrypted wallet on your mobile device or smartwatch in order to use your debit card with Apple Pay<sup>\u00ae<\/sup>, Google Pay<sup>\u2122<\/sup> or Samsung Pay.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-3 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<h3>Benefits of mobile wallets:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Secure Processing <\/strong>\u2014 When a payment is made in-store or online, a token is generated in place of your debit card number, so your card number is never stored on your device or with merchants, and all of your information remains secure.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Convenient Purchasing <\/strong>\u2014 Make in-store, online, or in-app purchases without reaching for your physical debit card. Simply tap your phone or smartwatch, or click a button to apply your secure payment credentials.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>All the perks of using a Averon Trust business debit card<\/strong> \u2014 Averon Trust will continue to monitor all purchases for fraud, and may even ask you to verify certain purchases. There are no additional fees for using this service.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Mobile-Wallet-CNSMR.jpg\" alt=\"A man's hand uses a Averon Trust Business Visa debit card in a mobile wallet at a contactless payment system\" class=\"wp-image-4394\" width=\"452\" height=\"412\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Mobile-Wallet-CNSMR.jpg 507w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Mobile-Wallet-CNSMR-300x273.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3>Here\u2019s how it works:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Check out these guides for instructions on how to enable <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/apple-mobile-wallet\/\">Apple Pay<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/google-mobile-wallet\/\">Google Pay<\/a>, or <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/samsung-mobile-wallet\/\">Samsung Pay<\/a> on your mobile device. Once your Averon Trust debit card has been added to your mobile wallet, here\u2019s how to use mobile wallet:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-constrained wp-block-group\">\n<p><strong>In Person<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Hold your device near the field communication reader on the credit card terminal or open the mobile wallet app on your device.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Select your Averon Trust debit card.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow your device\u2019s instructions to authenticate the purchase (i.e. biometric, face ID, PIN if applicable).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Online<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Choose your mobile wallet payment option at check out.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Select your Averon Trust debit card.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow your device\u2019s instructions to authenticate the purchase (i.e. biometric, face ID, PIN if applicable).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>Note: For first-time purchases, you may be asked to confirm your contact information; your information will be saved for future payments. Samsung Pay is not eligible for online purchases.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Questions? See our FAQs below or call our Customer Care team at <a href=\"tel:678-465-8306\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">678-465-8306<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\"><em>Apple, the Apple logo, Apple Pay, iPhone, TouchID and FaceID are trademarks of Apple Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries. Google Pay and the Google logo are trademarks of Google LLC.&nbsp;\u00a92018 Google LLC, used with permission. Google and the Google logo are registered trademarks of Google LLC. Samsung Pay and the Samsung logo are trademarks of Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2>\n\n\n<section class=\"faq aligncenter\">\n    <div class=\"accordion faq-wrap\" id=\"faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\">\n                                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-0\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What is a Mobile Wallet?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-0\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-0\"\n            >\n              What is a Mobile Wallet?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-0\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-0\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2652\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-300x178.png\" alt=\"Contactless payment logo\" width=\"132\" height=\"78\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-300x178.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-300x178.png 300w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-1024x607.png 1024w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-768x455.png 768w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 132px) 100vw, 132px\" \/> &nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2650\" role=\"img\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/google-pay-mark_800_gray.svg\" alt=\"Google pay logo\" width=\"122\" height=\"78\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/google-pay-mark_800_gray.svg\"> &nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2651\" role=\"img\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Apple_Pay_Mark_RGB_041619.svg\" alt=\"Apple pay logo\" width=\"122\" height=\"78\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Apple_Pay_Mark_RGB_041619.svg\"> &nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2653\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Samsung_Pay_Button_White-300x70.png\" alt=\"Samsun pay logo\" width=\"257\" height=\"60\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Samsung_Pay_Button_White-300x70.png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Samsung_Pay_Button_White-300x70.png 300w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Samsung_Pay_Button_White-1024x239.png 1024w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Samsung_Pay_Button_White-768x179.png 768w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Samsung_Pay_Button_White.png 1128w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 257px) 100vw, 257px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Mobile wallets allow you to link your Averon Trust debit card to the wallet on your mobile device so you may use your debit card with Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Samsung Pay.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Using your card in a mobile wallet adds an extra layer of convenience and security when shopping. When your card is in your mobile wallet, you may use your mobile device to make purchases in person and online without needing to have your physical debit card handy.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Mobile wallets use tokenization technology to encrypt your debit card number. When you check out in person or online using your mobile wallet, Visa uses a token value in place of your debit card number so that your card information remains secure.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-1\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about How do I add my Averon Trust debit card to my mobile wallet?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-1\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-1\"\n            >\n              How do I add my Averon Trust debit card to my mobile wallet?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-1\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-1\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>These guides will provide instructions on how to enable <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/apple-mobile-wallet\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-mce-href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/apple-mobile-wallet\/\">Apple Pay, <\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/google-mobile-wallet\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-mce-href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/google-mobile-wallet\/\">Google Pay,<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/samsung-mobile-wallet\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-mce-href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/samsung-mobile-wallet\/\">Samsung Pay <\/a>on your mobile device.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-2\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about How do I make my Averon Trust debit card my default card in my wallet?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-2\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-2\"\n            >\n              How do I make my Averon Trust debit card my default card in my wallet?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-2\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-2\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>On your Apple device, go to Settings and then Wallet &amp; Apple Pay. Under the Transaction Defaults section, select Default Card. The images of all cards in your wallet will appear. Select your Averon Trust consumer debit card.<\/p>\n<p>For Google Pay, the first card you add to Google Pay will be your default card. To change this to your Averon Trust card, open the Google Pay app and tap and drag your card to the \u201cDefault Card\u201d spot at the top of the app\u2019s home screen.<\/p>\n<p>While you cannot set a card as the default for Samsung Pay, you can scroll through your list of cards and select your Averon Trust card when making a payment. Samsung Pay will make the last card used the default card, so once you make a payment through Samsung Pay using your Averon Trust card, that card will be the default for future payments.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-3\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Is this secure?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-3\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-3\"\n            >\n              Is this secure?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-3\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-3\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>Yes! The mobile wallet uses a tokenization method to encrypt your debit card number.<\/p>\n<p>When your card is entered into your mobile wallet, Visa<sup>\u00ae<\/sup> issues a token that is used in place of your actual card number when processing payments from your mobile wallet. This token value is different from your card number and is stored in a secure digital vault with Visa.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-4\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Are there any fees to use this service?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-4\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-4\"\n            >\n              Are there any fees to use this service?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-4\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-4\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>No, there are no fees to use your Averon Trust debit card in your mobile wallet.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-5\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about Where can I use my mobile wallet?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-5\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-5\"\n            >\n              Where can I use my mobile wallet?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-5\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-5\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>Mobile wallets are accepted at many merchants, both in-person and online. Just look for the wallet or antennae logo at checkout or simply try your payment. Many merchants will accept your payment, however, some may not display the logos.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Samsung Pay is not available for use online.<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\" data-mce-style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-6\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What happens if I lose my debit card?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-6\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-6\"\n            >\n              What happens if I lose my debit card?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-6\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-6\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>Please contact Customer Care at <a href=\"tel:678-465-8306\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-mce-href=\"tel:678-465-8306\">678-465-8306<\/a> as soon as you realize that your card is missing. This will deactivate the card in your mobile wallet.<\/p>\n<p>Once you receive your new card, you will need to add the new card to your mobile wallet and delete the old card.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-7\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about If I turn off my card in Online Banking will it still work?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-7\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-7\"\n            >\n              If I turn off my card in Online Banking will it still work?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-7\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-7\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>No. If you turn off your card using online or mobile banking, you will need to turn it back on before using it. This can be done while you\u2019re at the store provided you have internet access.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-8\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about How do I know if my device supports this?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-8\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-8\"\n            >\n              How do I know if my device supports this?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-8\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-8\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p>Many devices made in the past few years support mobile wallets, including many new smartwatches. Please check with your device manufacturer for more details.<\/p>\n\n              <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                            <div class=\"faq-question\">\n            <div class=\"faq-heading\" id=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-9\">\n            <button\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              class=\"\"\n              aria-label=\"Read more about What logos should I look for?\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-9\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-9\"\n            >\n              What logos should I look for?\n            <\/button>\n            <\/div>\n            <div\n                class=\"faq-answer accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"heading-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-9\"\n                id=\"collapse-faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34-9\"\n                data-bs-parent=\"#faq-block_abf622852ad573463b38ae3c53fb1a34\"\n              >\n              <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                <p><em><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2652\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-300x178.png\" alt=\"Touchless pay logo\" width=\"159\" height=\"94\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-300x178.png 300w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/1200px-Universal_Contactless_Card_Symbol_svg-1024x607.png 1024w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/